        "note": "An earlier and independent Lean formalization of Sendov's conjecture for all n >= 2, by Lech Mazur, reported there as 1160 files and 92816 lines with a single main theorem. This development shares no code with it, was written from the blog-post digestion rather than from that proof, and additionally proves the Phelps-Rodriguez equality classification, which that formalization does not state. The two are independent evidence for the same theorem; priority for the first machine-checked proof of Sendov's conjecture belongs to that work.",
